          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Amazon is a fine place to buy a treadmill you have already chosen.</strong>
            It is a poor place to choose one from scratch, because titles, motor ratings and pooled
            reviews can all mislead. Check the seller, the continuous horsepower, the running surface
            and the return terms for that listing before you order.
          </p>
